<title>SWEDEN: Adtranz says wins 1.15 bln SKR British order.</title>
<headline>Adtranz says wins 1.15 bln SKR British order.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>International railway systems company Adtranz said on Thursday it had won an order worth 1.15 billion crowns ($150 million) from Connex Rail Ltd in Britain for 30 four-wagon multiple unit trains of the Electrostar model.</p>
<p>Adtranz, which is jointly owned by ABB and Daimler-Benz, said the contract included an option for another 800 wagons.</p>
<p>($ = 7.683 Swedish Crowns)</p>
